://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_643955654606405_480568527955268312_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qiNPnv8mPtsQ7kNvwGtg3uc&_nc_oc=AdoSjKxMQ5ux9jbMnRcTAlSa8EQm6vJfPz3mV-6Diy2IH8R5d73TULXUJS_2HjQAbsE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAAJbbN53KuPvM6jtzEcDRLE1c7mXyVwCYvkRErOKBZ0g&oe=6A510AE6"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_34_53.Still005.png", "id": "868776144968854", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574721_868776148302187_2395318248093284663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QVjGhNz8bW4Q7kNvwEXtpBJ&_nc_oc=Ado1sgbRMOYvFlwcrx_FqIJGuiKDlZfPk_8RZMlLOQ4O7h6ATFJA48a3RndDaaupBbk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCp96RWTO3M5b9l6hASDDVN-VoDcveqpQTL8XlRrlxsRg&oe=6A510032"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_25_53.Still002.png", "id": "692760662818107", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_692760666151440_1673600769700015261_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rGu6uuTD5Q8Q7kNvwHqLE_7&_nc_oc=AdpVLgqJ1jIgvWi2s1x4pJFbJUf8BLjiMSJJyZMeOJNNuSyWO-Uuw4hdTV1UggPLOo0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCcIDDv8tc8S2n0pot4V6xl39pqezutGHtOMi7fIbfnXg&oe=6A50F9FB"}, {"file_name": "2023-07-01 19-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "1014728119759484", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974571_1014728126426150_3738956639406327634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UsTqiTwGhu8Q7kNvwETgJi9&_nc_oc=AdobNIkfI36Bh6rlBglhESsBACVIg_dqva8RbXNRCIs0xbKOAPN22mqF9j0BHdeppd0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCYq9ff7CGSJIcQRuJwEkIKUyUnRq22TF0Zl8B62psMOA&oe=6A510F73"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m29iaNER71IQ7kNvwGNHQIR&_nc_oc=Adqaj4HHEdzvm50s7z4PN0SPzkl0Vs8mO8pu_1XHyQ8hi4de_sufkbP2djHUrpZbfw4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBxPtYdGUZYo2YIbSPl6nKyFvC0jbmaPNW1I0iq0mLJkg&oe=6A510D72"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Ziggy_Monoscopic.png", "id": "1296582511245835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974446_1296582517912501_8438674573824683709_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=efb3FcGcZSwQ7kNvwHxCoGd&_nc_oc=Adoh3_QD-Nen8h07LbOVQKR_JKwhDbR5PGC1ydFXc8qG5hy9JPi1MFyndO8dyTi3_Gg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCNUdBXRBq9Ze6AVFpNfZqGRxC7EoJ9Hz3LY8Uq6tA_XA&oe=6A5104D3"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "1124369782419830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036658_1124369785753163_6062844584904789074_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tPsKP0xQVe8Q7kNvwHtBYnN&_nc_oc=AdqcpCQWDcuTDfJ8DmRgd_-kKvlP0RcmTGSxxq4pvJ1JyEK7qzVPO69DH4xtfN-EFEY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBzytFx323rPVhTBahNhNe0pM0pavBqSVWmFy2oR2BLFw&oe=6A5100EF"}, {"file_name": "Icon_v1.png", "id": "1106448921139578", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1106448927806244_1890053882317213161_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7hNwqHbDgGYQ7kNvwHsrgbA&_nc_oc=AdqUBW2AzMPqT3mbdqMX_Je0Kyikivw_FXkYg4xRVnpxXtYNhpA_1f_xal-CidYlBIw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDjDec3Rvd3jqafrZXNj2A86LdG8PmKOZjYSKTHC7YR0A&oe=6A510CA2"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "973425620588096", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610716_973425627254762_521808747164